-- input.md --
Mathematical operators test:

Basic operators: $+ - \times \div \pm \mp$

Relations: $= \neq < > \leq \geq \ll \gg \approx \equiv \sim \simeq \cong \propto$

Set theory: $\in \notin \subset \supset \subseteq \supseteq \cup \cap \emptyset \varnothing$

Arrows: $\rightarrow \leftarrow \leftrightarrow \Rightarrow \Leftarrow \Leftrightarrow \mapsto \to$

Functions: $\sin \cos \tan \log \ln \exp \max \min \sup \inf \lim$

