<p>Mathematical operators test:</p>
<p>Basic operators: <math class="math-textstyle" display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>÷</mo><mo>±</mo><mo>∓</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">+ - \times \div \pm \mp</annotation></semantics></math></p>
<p>Relations: <math class="math-textstyle" display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>≠</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>≤</mo><mo>≥</mo><mo>≪</mo><mo>≫</mo><mo>≈</mo><mo>≡</mo><mo>∼</mo><mo>≃</mo><mo>≅</mo><mo>∝</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">= \neq &lt; &gt; \leq \geq \ll \gg \approx \equiv \sim \simeq \cong \propto</annotation></semantics></math></p>
<p>Set theory: <math class="math-textstyle" display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>∈</mo><mo>∉</mo><mo>⊂</mo><mo>⊃</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo>⊇</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo>∩</mo><mi>∅</mi><mi>⌀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in \notin \subset \supset \subseteq \supseteq \cup \cap \emptyset \varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></p>
<p>Arrows: <math class="math-textstyle" display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo><mo>←</mo><mo>↔</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mo>⇐</mo><mo>⇔</mo><mo>↦</mo><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow \leftarrow \leftrightarrow \Rightarrow \Leftarrow \Leftrightarrow \mapsto \to</annotation></semantics></math></p>
